    "text": "wcti12.com\nwebsite\nBeaufort\nSafety concerns prompt temporary closure of T-Dock at West Beaufort Water Access site\nBy Alberto Cardoso,\n12 hours agoThe T-Dock and connecting ramp at the West Beaufort Water Access site, located at 138 Town Creek Drive in Beaufort, are temporarily closed following an inspection that identified safety issues. The closure affects only the T-Dock and its connected ramp, while the site's primary boat ramps and launch area remain...\n2",
